This project includes 37 playbooks adapted from an upstream troubleshooting
baseline. The baseline commit and original attribution are preserved in the
project history; current files use generic host-Agent wording and
"author: upstream-maintainers". This project adds a portable Agent Skill
workflow, host-tool mappings, safety guidance, installers, validation, and
25 Windows/Linux playbooks marked "source: local".

Upstream baseline repository:
https://github.com/noahapp/noah-for-tinkerers
Baseline commit: e5e5536bcb925358d65d8dc6812ee6c49722373b

The following repositories were reviewed on the listed commit or supplied
working tree. Only behavioral observations and safety boundaries were used; no
source code, binary or remote installer was copied into this project.

ZyperWave/ZyperWinOptimize and tsgrgo/windows-update-disabler did not contain a
license file in the reviewed trees. They were used only for behavioral
observation and safety-boundary review; neither repository is treated as a
code, asset, binary, or installer source for this project.

